### Edit consultation slot (doctor only, slot must be AVAILABLE)
### Run api/auth/login.http first — the jwt variable is captured automatically.
### Replace the UUID in the path with the actual consultation id.
PUT http://localhost:8030/consultation/edit/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

{
  "date": "2026-05-15",
  "startTime": "14:00:00",
  "duration": 45,
  "price": 250.00
}

###
